# PROGRAM 4 nested: lists nested inside a returned feed wrapper
#
# Hand written Brainfuck in the house style of text dot bf: comments never
# hold a command character; @cell checkpoints and tilde run lengths are
# checked by tools/bftool/lint
#
# Port of NestedCollectionSanitizer from 1 2 1: one request visits one value
# and visits its children by CALLing this program one level deeper; a
# replaced list is written back through the slot it was read from
#
# OP 51 NESTED SANITIZE: handle u32; answers removed u32; failures u32
# OP 52 NESTED VISIT: handle u32; depth; budget u16; has replacer; slot
# declared Object or unknown; slot interface; slot accepts ArrayList;
# answers removed u32; failures u32; budget u16
#
# Limits: depth 4; budget 192 visits per traversal; 48 entries per list
# map or array
#
# Every if copies its subject into a temp flag t and runs the body once
# while the flag is set; an else keeps a second flag; numbers are little
# endian and compare from the high byte down
#
# Cells
#
# %cell maj 0
# %cell min 1
# %cell op 2
# %cell flg 3
# %cell len 4 2
# %cell id 6 2
# %cell st 8
